{"units": [{"i": 0, "p": 0, "t0": 0.0, "t1": 2.02, "text": "Ambil segelas es teh di siang hari.", "v0": 3.0, "v1": 5.02}, {"i": 1, "p": 0, "t0": 2.22, "t1": 5.24, "text": "Tidak lama kemudian, bagian luar gelasnya basah.", "v0": 5.22, "v1": 8.24}, {"i": 2, "p": 0, "t0": 5.71, "t1": 7.35, "text": "Padahal gelasnya tidak bocor.", "v0": 8.71, "v1": 10.35}, {"i": 3, "p": 0, "t0": 7.99, "t1": 9.23, "text": "Dari mana air itu datang?", "v0": 10.99, "v1": 12.23}, {"i": 4, "p": 1, "t0": 9.77, "t1": 10.35, "text": "Jawabannya:", "v0": 12.77, "v1": 13.35}, {"i": 5, "p": 1, "t0": 10.64, "t1": 11.49, "text": "dari udara.", "v0": 13.64, "v1": 14.49}, {"i": 6, "p": 1, "t0": 12.05, "t1": 17.81, "text": "Udara di sekitar kita selalu membawa air dalam bentuk gas yang tidak terlihat, yaitu uap air.", "v0": 15.05, "v1": 20.81}, {"i": 7, "p": 2, "t0": 18.36, "t1": 22.42, "text": "Uap air itu berasal dari laut, danau, dan tanah yang menguap.", "v0": 21.36, "v1": 25.42}, {"i": 8, "p": 2, "t0": 23.02, "t1": 24.81, "text": "Prosesnya disebut evaporasi.", "v0": 26.02, "v1": 27.81}, {"i": 9, "p": 2, "t0": 25.32, "t1": 27.84, "text": "Tumbuhan juga melepaskan uap air lewat daunnya.", "v0": 28.32, "v1": 30.84}, {"i": 10, "p": 2, "t0": 28.3, "t1": 29.76, "text": "Ini disebut transpirasi.", "v0": 31.3, "v1": 32.76}, {"i": 11, "p": 2, "t0": 30.26, "t1": 34.89, "text": "Gabungan keduanya disebut evapotranspirasi, atau evapotranspiration.", "v0": 33.26, "v1": 37.89}, {"i": 12, "p": 3, "t0": 35.11, "t1": 37.24, "text": "Sekarang bayangkan udara itu seperti gelas.", "v0": 38.11, "v1": 40.24}, {"i": 13, "p": 3, "t0": 37.85, "t1": 39.35, "text": "Uap air adalah isinya.", "v0": 40.85, "v1": 42.35}, {"i": 14, "p": 3, "t0": 40.01, "t1": 42.27, "text": "Yang menarik, ukuran gelas ini tidak tetap.", "v0": 43.01, "v1": 45.27}, {"i": 15, "p": 3, "t0": 42.81, "t1": 44.25, "text": "Gelasnya bergantung pada suhu.", "v0": 45.81, "v1": 47.25}, {"i": 16, "p": 4, "t0": 44.84, "t1": 46.93, "text": "Saat udara hangat, gelasnya besar.", "v0": 47.84, "v1": 49.93}, {"i": 17, "p": 4, "t0": 47.46, "t1": 49.61, "text": "Udara bisa menampung banyak uap air.", "v0": 50.46, "v1": 52.61}, {"i": 18, "p": 4, "t0": 50.27, "t1": 52.52, "text": "Saat udara dingin, gelasnya mengecil.", "v0": 53.27, "v1": 55.52}, {"i": 19, "p": 4, "t0": 53.13, "t1": 57.89, "text": "Kira-kira, setiap suhu naik satu derajat, gelasnya membesar sekitar tujuh persen.", "v0": 56.13, "v1": 60.89}, {"i": 20, "p": 5, "t0": 58.6, "t1": 62.07, "text": "Mari kita kenalan dengan Si Gumpal, segumpal udara di atas sawah.", "v0": 61.6, "v1": 65.07}, {"i": 21, "p": 5, "t0": 62.74, "t1": 64.72, "text": "Siang ini suhunya tiga puluh derajat.", "v0": 65.74, "v1": 67.72}, {"i": 22, "p": 5, "t0": 65.03, "t1": 68.55, "text": "Gelasnya mampu menampung dua puluh gram uap air per kilogram udara.", "v0": 68.03, "v1": 71.55}, {"i": 23, "p": 5, "t0": 68.86, "t1": 71.44, "text": "Saat ini, Si Gumpal membawa lima belas gram.", "v0": 71.86, "v1": 74.44}, {"i": 24, "p": 6, "t0": 71.68, "t1": 74.23, "text": "Ada tiga cara mengukur kelembapan Si Gumpal.", "v0": 74.68, "v1": 77.23}, {"i": 25, "p": 7, "t0": 74.9, "t1": 78.55, "text": "Pertama, berapa gram uap air dalam setiap meter kubik udara.", "v0": 77.9, "v1": 81.55}, {"i": 26, "p": 7, "t0": 79.21, "t1": 81.86, "text": "Ini kelembapan mutlak, atau absolute humidity.", "v0": 82.21, "v1": 84.86}, {"i": 27, "p": 8, "t0": 82.56, "t1": 86.12, "text": "Kedua, berapa gram uap air dalam setiap kilogram udara.", "v0": 85.56, "v1": 89.12}, {"i": 28, "p": 8, "t0": 86.81, "t1": 89.85, "text": "Ini kelembapan spesifik, atau specific humidity.", "v0": 89.81, "v1": 92.85}, {"i": 29, "p": 8, "t0": 90.49, "t1": 95.44, "text": "Angka ini tidak berubah walaupun Si Gumpal mengembang, selama tidak ada uap air yang hilang.", "v0": 93.49, "v1": 98.44}, {"i": 30, "p": 9, "t0": 95.62, "t1": 97.7, "text": "Ketiga, yang paling sering dipakai:", "v0": 98.62, "v1": 100.7}, {"i": 31, "p": 9, "t0": 98.07, "t1": 99.57, "text": "seberapa penuh gelasnya.", "v0": 101.07, "v1": 102.57}, {"i": 32, "p": 9, "t0": 100.17, "t1": 102.95, "text": "Ini kelembapan relatif, atau relative humidity.", "v0": 103.17, "v1": 105.95}, {"i": 33, "p": 9, "t0": 103.62, "t1": 106.42, "text": "Isi dibagi kapasitas, dikali seratus persen.", "v0": 106.62, "v1": 109.42}, {"i": 34, "p": 9, "t0": 107.09, "t1": 111.46, "text": "Untuk Si Gumpal, lima belas dibagi dua puluh, yaitu tujuh puluh lima persen.", "v0": 110.09, "v1": 114.46}, {"i": 35, "p": 10, "t0": 112.13, "t1": 113.17, "text": "Sekarang malam tiba.", "v0": 115.13, "v1": 116.17}, {"i": 36, "p": 10, "t0": 113.48, "t1": 114.6, "text": "Si Gumpal mendingin.", "v0": 116.48, "v1": 117.6}, {"i": 37, "p": 10, "t0": 115.09, "t1": 118.23, "text": "Isinya tetap lima belas gram, tetapi gelasnya mengecil.", "v0": 118.09, "v1": 121.23}, {"i": 38, "p": 10, "t0": 118.93, "t1": 125.57, "text": "Kelembapan relatifnya naik, delapan puluh, sembilan puluh, sampai akhirnya gelasnya pas berisi lima belas gram.", "v0": 121.93, "v1": 128.57}, {"i": 39, "p": 10, "t0": 126.18, "t1": 126.79, "text": "Gelas penuh.", "v0": 129.18, "v1": 129.79}, {"i": 40, "p": 10, "t0": 127.45, "t1": 129.29, "text": "Kelembapan relatif seratus persen.", "v0": 130.45, "v1": 132.29}, {"i": 41, "p": 11, "t0": 129.48, "t1": 133.45, "text": "Udara yang gelasnya penuh disebut udara jenuh, atau saturated.", "v0": 132.48, "v1": 136.45}, {"i": 42, "p": 11, "t0": 134.12, "t1": 139.14, "text": "Suhu saat udara mulai jenuh disebut titik embun, atau dew point.", "v0": 137.12, "v1": 142.14}, {"i": 43, "p": 12, "t0": 139.81, "t1": 143.82, "text": "Kalau Si Gumpal terus mendingin di bawah titik embun, gelasnya tidak muat lagi.", "v0": 142.81, "v1": 146.82}, {"i": 44, "p": 12, "t0": 144.34, "t1": 147.24, "text": "Uap air yang berlebih berubah menjadi titik-titik air.", "v0": 147.34, "v1": 150.24}, {"i": 45, "p": 12, "t0": 147.9, "t1": 153.24, "text": "Inilah embun di rumput pagi hari, kabut di lembah, dan air di luar gelas es teh tadi.", "v0": 150.9, "v1": 156.24}, {"i": 46, "p": 12, "t0": 153.95, "t1": 158.41, "text": "Gelas yang dingin mendinginkan udara di sekitarnya sampai melewati titik embun.", "v0": 156.95, "v1": 161.41}, {"i": 47, "p": 13, "t0": 158.64, "t1": 159.15, "text": "Jadi ingat:", "v0": 161.64, "v1": 162.15}, {"i": 48, "p": 13, "t0": 159.68, "t1": 163.86, "text": "embun dan awan terbentuk karena udara didinginkan, bukan dipanaskan.", "v0": 162.68, "v1": 166.86}, {"i": 49, "p": 14, "t0": 164.54, "t1": 166.55, "text": "Sekarang, coba kerjakan soal ini.", "v0": 167.54, "v1": 169.55}, {"i": 50, "p": 15, "t0": 167.1, "t1": 173.88, "text": "Kelembapan relatif sama dengan dua belas dibagi enam belas, dikali seratus persen, yaitu tujuh puluh lima persen.", "v0": 174.1, "v1": 180.88}, {"i": 51, "p": 15, "t0": 174.56, "t1": 179.69, "text": "Agar jenuh, udara harus didinginkan sampai kapasitasnya tinggal dua belas gram.", "v0": 181.56, "v1": 186.69}, {"i": 52, "p": 15, "t0": 180.31, "t1": 181.47, "text": "Jadi jawabannya B.", "v0": 187.31, "v1": 188.47}, {"i": 53, "p": 16, "t0": 182.01, "t1": 183.03, "text": "Ada dua jebakan.", "v0": 189.01, "v1": 190.03}, {"i": 54, "p": 16, "t0": 183.75, "t1": 187.21, "text": "Pertama, kenaikan suhu tidak menyebabkan kondensasi.", "v0": 190.75, "v1": 194.21}, {"i": 55, "p": 16, "t0": 187.87, "t1": 190.56, "text": "Justru pendinginanlah yang membuat udara jenuh.", "v0": 194.87, "v1": 197.56}, {"i": 56, "p": 16, "t0": 190.86, "t1": 195.24, "text": "Kedua, kelembapan relatif tinggi tidak selalu berarti uap airnya banyak.", "v0": 197.86, "v1": 202.24}, {"i": 57, "p": 16, "t0": 195.89, "t1": 201.25, "text": "Udara kutub yang dingin bisa jenuh walaupun uap airnya sedikit, karena gelasnya sangat kecil.", "v0": 202.89, "v1": 208.25}, {"i": 58, "p": 17, "t0": 201.92, "t1": 202.57, "text": "Ringkasnya:", "v0": 208.92, "v1": 209.57}, {"i": 59, "p": 17, "t0": 202.96, "t1": 211.01, "text": "suhu menentukan besar gelas, kelembapan relatif adalah seberapa penuh gelasnya, dan saat gelas penuh, udara jenuh di titik embun.", "v0": 209.96, "v1": 218.01}, {"i": 60, "p": 17, "t0": 211.75, "t1": 214.63, "text": "Berikutnya, kita ikuti Si Gumpal naik ke atas.", "v0": 218.75, "v1": 221.63}, {"i": 61, "p": 17, "t0": 215.07, "t1": 218.97, "text": "Latihan soalnya ada di O S N Geo titik I D.", "v0": 222.07, "v1": 225.97}], "words": [{"w": "Ambil", "t": 3.0, "u": 0}, {"w": "segelas", "t": 3.34, "u": 0}, {"w": "es", "t": 3.84, "u": 0}, {"w": "teh", "t": 4.01, "u": 0}, {"w": "di", "t": 4.18, "u": 0}, {"w": "siang", "t": 4.35, "u": 0}, {"w": "hari.", "t": 4.68, "u": 0}, {"w": "Tidak", "t": 5.22, "u": 1}, {"w": "lama", "t": 5.59, "u": 1}, {"w": "kemudian,", "t": 5.96, "u": 1}, {"w": "bagian", "t": 6.7, "u": 1}, {"w": "luar", "t": 7.17, "u": 1}, {"w": "gelasnya", "t": 7.47, "u": 1}, {"w": "basah.", "t": 7.93, "u": 1}, {"w": "Padahal", "t": 8.71, "u": 2}, {"w": "gelasnya", "t": 9.2, "u": 2}, {"w": "tidak", "t": 9.69, "u": 2}, {"w": "bocor.", "t": 10.02, "u": 2}, {"w": "Dari", "t": 10.99, "u": 3}, {"w": "mana", "t": 11.24, "u": 3}, {"w": "air", "t": 11.49, "u": 3}, {"w": "itu", "t": 11.73, "u": 3}, {"w": "datang?", "t": 11.98, "u": 3}, {"w": "Jawabannya:", "t": 12.77, "u": 4}, {"w": "dari", "t": 13.64, "u": 5}, {"w": "udara.", "t": 13.98, "u": 5}, {"w": "Udara", "t": 15.05, "u": 6}, {"w": "di", "t": 15.51, "u": 6}, {"w": "sekitar", "t": 15.67, "u": 6}, {"w": "kita", "t": 16.13, "u": 6}, {"w": "selalu", "t": 16.43, "u": 6}, {"w": "membawa", "t": 16.9, "u": 6}, {"w": "air", "t": 17.36, "u": 6}, {"w": "dalam", "t": 17.67, "u": 6}, {"w": "bentuk", "t": 17.97, "u": 6}, {"w": "gas", "t": 18.28, "u": 6}, {"w": "yang", "t": 18.43, "u": 6}, {"w": "tidak", "t": 18.59, "u": 6}, {"w": "terlihat,", "t": 18.9, "u": 6}, {"w": "yaitu", "t": 19.36, "u": 6}, {"w": "uap", "t": 19.98, "u": 6}, {"w": "air.", "t": 20.39, "u": 6}, {"w": "Uap", "t": 21.36, "u": 7}, {"w": "air", "t": 21.68, "u": 7}, {"w": "itu", "t": 22.0, "u": 7}, {"w": "berasal", "t": 22.32, "u": 7}, {"w": "dari", "t": 22.8, "u": 7}, {"w": "laut,", "t": 23.11, "u": 7}, {"w": "danau,", "t": 23.43, "u": 7}, {"w": "dan", "t": 24.25, "u": 7}, {"w": "tanah", "t": 24.42, "u": 7}, {"w": "yang", "t": 24.75, "u": 7}, {"w": "menguap.", "t": 24.92, "u": 7}, {"w": "Prosesnya", "t": 26.02, "u": 8}, {"w": "disebut", "t": 26.51, "u": 8}, {"w": "evaporasi.", "t": 27.0, "u": 8}, {"w": "Tumbuhan", "t": 28.32, "u": 9}, {"w": "juga", "t": 28.74, "u": 9}, {"w": "melepaskan", "t": 29.02, "u": 9}, {"w": "uap", "t": 29.58, "u": 9}, {"w": "air", "t": 29.86, "u": 9}, {"w": "lewat", "t": 30.14, "u": 9}, {"w": "daunnya.", "t": 30.42, "u": 9}, {"w": "Ini", "t": 31.3, "u": 10}, {"w": "disebut", "t": 31.62, "u": 10}, {"w": "transpirasi.", "t": 32.11, "u": 10}, {"w": "Gabungan", "t": 33.26, "u": 11}, {"w": "keduanya", "t": 33.75, "u": 11}, {"w": "disebut", "t": 34.4, "u": 11}, {"w": "evapotranspirasi,", "t": 34.89, "u": 11}, {"w": "atau", "t": 36.04, "u": 11}, {"w": "evapotranspiration.", "t": 36.54, "u": 11}, {"w": "Sekarang", "t": 38.11, "u": 12}, {"w": "bayangkan", "t": 38.51, "u": 12}, {"w": "udara", "t": 38.91, "u": 12}, {"w": "itu", "t": 39.31, "u": 12}, {"w": "seperti", "t": 39.57, "u": 12}, {"w": "gelas.", "t": 39.97, "u": 12}, {"w": "Uap", "t": 40.85, "u": 13}, {"w": "air", "t": 41.15, "u": 13}, {"w": "adalah", "t": 41.45, "u": 13}, {"w": "isinya.", "t": 41.9, "u": 13}, {"w": "Yang", "t": 43.01, "u": 14}, {"w": "menarik,", "t": 43.25, "u": 14}, {"w": "ukuran", "t": 43.95, "u": 14}, {"w": "gelas", "t": 44.31, "u": 14}, {"w": "ini", "t": 44.55, "u": 14}, {"w": "tidak", "t": 44.79, "u": 14}, {"w": "tetap.", "t": 45.03, "u": 14}, {"w": "Gelasnya", "t": 45.81, "u": 15}, {"w": "bergantung", "t": 46.24, "u": 15}, {"w": "pada", "t": 46.67, "u": 15}, {"w": "suhu.", "t": 46.96, "u": 15}, {"w": "Saat", "t": 47.84, "u": 16}, {"w": "udara", "t": 48.18, "u": 16}, {"w": "hangat,", "t": 48.69, "u": 16}, {"w": "gelasnya", "t": 49.03, "u": 16}, {"w": "besar.", "t": 49.57, "u": 16}, {"w": "Uda